# Ignore everything, then re-include exactly what this repository publishes.
#
# The working tree happens to be a larger scratch workspace that also holds
# unrelated personal files next to these two packages. A whitelist is the only
# safe shape here: a careless `git add -A` then cannot publish anything that is
# not named below, and `git status` stays quiet about the rest.
/*
!/dsh-balance-float/
!/dsh-audio-reward/
!/tools/
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE

# Nested safety nets: these are unanchored, so they apply inside each package
# too, should a checkout ever grow them.
node_modules/
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
